{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1405468800, "end_date": 1406159999, "month_true_total": 366, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:44 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "11381916", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969959046", "personaname": "Jack9579", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jack9579/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 249, "last_played": 1448324967, "avatar": "4f9315a081ffd8e458bcab7822ec8e2083baed24"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun with friends, challenging alone.  I wish the experience and upgrade system was laid out in the game, its like a mystery.", "timestamp_created": 1406151601, "timestamp_updated": 1406151601, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11381840", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043428449", "personaname": "alamoramos", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043428449/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 1501, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1424, "last_played": 1437454127, "avatar": "ebb1b6eaaa52afa50f34bfb740e6ddc38ddc5e65"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is pretty darn fun Untill you get the artifact \"Glass\". In which your pretty darn op. If your a person who doesn't like it when your basicly cheating then don't use it. There is so much to accomplish in the game that using that would most likely spoil it for you. I'm still working on obtaining everything and I can say it's a super fun experience.", "timestamp_created": 1406151197, "timestamp_updated": 1406151197, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11379410", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083956579", "personaname": "Wyvie", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198083956579/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played": 1554874605, "avatar": "53a9b8ccc70eef8f42cda1aa5fa68874529371cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game, especially with friends. The soundtrack for this game is beautiful and in my opinion worth the price of the game.\n\nOne problem I have is that the framerate seems to be capped to 30FPS on my main rig ( 3570k @4Ghz, GTX660, 8GB ram ), but on my 6 year old budget laptop runs fine at 60FPS (until the busy final levels anyway). \n\nIn summary: \n- definitely worth getting for mindless fun and awesome soundtrack!", "timestamp_created": 1406139621, "timestamp_updated": 1406139621, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11379037", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044254493", "personaname": "John Carmack: Technomancer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jeepuschrystler/", "num_games_owned": 1083, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 6280, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6275, "last_played": 1495885699, "avatar": "4726d1ca0307513418fa1c8fc0c75b2eace0634a"}, "language": "english", "review": "A breath of fresh air for those of us who still pay attention to indie games and hope they'll be almost as good as Cave Story, Risk of Rain offers challenging gameplay, tons of content and things to unlock,  and loads of replay value.\n\nFor those of you who have adapted your lungs to breathe giant worms made of lava and flying electric jellyfish, this is the game for you.", "timestamp_created": 1406137944, "timestamp_updated": 1486975155, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11376383", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054368317", "personaname": "Jones", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198054368317/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 16206, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10963, "last_played": 1560337423, "avatar": "1f472ce8e278212d9fae2bae6ae623953f983738"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain brings enough Playtime to make it into a challenging game. The Coop mode (either local or not) is very stable, and is capable of withstanding the demand.\n\nHowever, I think it is time for a DLC or a sequel, since this game has been around for more than a year without huge implementations.\n\nI strongly believe this game can, and will make you spend several hours trying to master all classes and their skills.", "timestamp_created": 1406125588, "timestamp_updated": 1406125588, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}